NAME
  vtkSHYXAutoMeshRepair
DESCRIPTION
  "SHYX: detect self-intersecting face clusters, dilate each, local hole-fill + Alpha Wrap + union + bridge remesh/smooth."
GROUPS
  Meshing
DEPENDS
  vtkCGALAlgorithm
  vtkCGALPMP
  vtkSHYXSelectionFillAlphaReunionFilter
  VTK::FiltersCore
  VTK::FiltersGeometry
PRIVATE_DEPENDS
  VTK::CommonCore
  VTK::CommonDataModel
  VTK::CommonExecutionModel
